<title>HONG KONG: Qingling Motors 1996 net jumps 140 pct.</title>
<headline>Qingling Motors 1996 net jumps 140 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		0.21     vs 0.09</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	 0.10     vs 0.05</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			 426.29   vs 177.62</p>
<p>    Turnover		  3,924.56 vs 3,361.05</p>
<p>    Company name	    Qingling Motors Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     May 12 to June 11</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	June 20</p>
<p>NOTE - Qingling Motors is a China-incorporated truck assembler.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 0.10 yuan vs 0.05 yuan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
